---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About SR Infotech | Direct Inventory Buying for Brands" description="SR Infotech buys surplus stock directly from brands, retailers and ecommerce businesses. Based in Bengaluru, with our own pickup logistics across India.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{name:'About us'}]} /><div class="split-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">A DIRECT BUYING RELATIONSHIP</span><h1>Your brand’s surplus.<br />Our buying focus.</h1><p>SR Infotech buys bulk surplus inventory directly from brands, retailers and ecommerce businesses across India. We work with the teams responsible for the stock, from the initial lot overview to agreed collection.</p></div><img src="/images/hero.webp" srcset="/images/hero-small.webp 640w, /images/hero.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 92vw, 45vw" alt="Illustrative warehouse with stocked pallet racks, bulk cartons and an unattended forklift" width="1200" height="1200" /></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container intro-layout"><div><span class="eyebrow">A BUSINESS BUILT AROUND YOUR NEXT MOVE</span><h2>A practical way to<br />move surplus stock.</h2></div><div><p>Changing demand, customer returns and new collections are part of doing business. Keeping that stock indefinitely doesn’t have to be.</p><p>We buy across apparel, footwear, home and kitchen, and electronics. With our own logistics for pickup across India, we bring the buying conversation and the movement of goods together.</p><p>Based in Bengaluru. Focused on opportunities across the country.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section insights-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT</span><h2>Direct. Practical.<br />Ready to talk business.</h2></div></div><div class="solution-grid"><div><div class="icon-badge"><Icon name="box" /></div><h3 style="margin-block:22px 14px">A direct buyer</h3><p>Speak to the business considering your stock for purchase. Keep the conversation focused on the lot and its potential.</p></div><div><div class="icon-badge"><Icon name="truck" /></div><h3 style="margin-block:22px 14px">Our own logistics</h3><p>A buying relationship with pickup capability across India. Tell us where your goods are and we’ll discuss the arrangements.</p></div><div><div class="icon-badge"><Icon name="layers" /></div><h3 style="margin-block:22px 14px">A broader view of stock</h3><p>From fresh overstock to untested electronics, we look at the opportunity in each lot and discuss the commercial fit.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <CTA />
</BaseLayout>
